{"id":"620372","name":"葱香腊肉蘑菇蒸饺","author":"食·色","authorId":"34360","desc":"","cover":"images/620372/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"腊肉蘑菇馅","amount":"120克"},{"name":"葱","amount":"30克"},{"name":"饺子皮","amount":"10张"}],"sub":[]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"用料：腊肉蘑菇馅120克，葱30克，饺子皮10张。","img":"images/620372/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"葱洗净切成葱花，备用。","img":"images/620372/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"锅烧热，放入腊肉馅中火加热至油脂完全融化。","img":"images/620372/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入葱花。","img":"images/620372/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"翻炒均匀，关火。","img":"images/620372/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"出锅，晾凉。","img":"images/620372/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取一张饺子皮，放入适量馅料。","img":"images/620372/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"捏褶，成弯月形。","img":"images/620372/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"全部包好。","img":"images/620372/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"摆入蒸屉。","img":"images/620372/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"水开后上锅蒸15分钟，关火焖三五分钟。","img":"images/620372/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"揭盖。","img":"images/620372/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"出锅。","img":"images/620372/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"葱的用量可以根据自己口味酌情调整。\n蒸制时间需根据实际情况酌情调整。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}